-- Boss leashes for Heroic and Mythic dungeons (#11417), as set in game with .leash on the dev realm and tested there.
-- A boss evades when it leaves the polygon of its leash points, or with fewer than 3 points the circle of `radius`
-- yards around its spawn point. Bosses whose fight closes a gate get none (Darkmaster Gandling, Baron Rivendare,
-- the Seven in Blackrock Depths, Warchief Rend Blackhand).
